# Common Ground bounded production lock

This successor preserves the original planning freeze in iterations/planning-freeze/. Council-v2 direction passed independent judgment; the user delegated remaining in-scope decisions. Runtime implementation begins only after exact three-director scene signatures and the contract gate. Public release remains ch4-arrival; publication is false.

Preimplementation live authority files are immutable snapshots here because their live counterparts are declared implementation outputs; signed canon is independently pinned. No mutable runtime output is misrepresented as byte-frozen authority. All unrelated dirty work remains protected.

## Locked scope

The exact four ch13 beats and allowed paths below bind this implementation.

## Protected paths

Every protected path below remains unchanged by this work.

## Stop conditions

Runtime starts only after exact three-director signatures and passing contract gate. Unrelated dirty work is preserved; no publication. Report actual failures without fabricated acceptance.

## Lock disposition

Bounded runtime preparation authorized under standing user delegation; exact signed contract still required before runtime edits.

